    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n49466" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Turdŭli</span></b> , ōrum,
			m., <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>a people in Bœtica</i>, <i>living to
				the east of the Turdetani</i>, <i><span class="en">Varr.
				R. R. 2, 10, 4</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Liv. 28,
				39, 8</span></i>.—Hence, <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Tur-dŭlus</span></b> , a, um,
			adj., <i>of</i> or <i>relating
				to the Turduli</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">bellum,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Liv.
					34, 20, 2</span></i>
			.</div>
